    "would you": "\\b[Ww]ould you(?=\\s+(please\\s+)?(help|fix|check|look|take|write|add|make|split|deploy|change|set|run|sort|deal|handle|refactor|clean|update|remove|delete|create|build|implement|figure|tell|get|see|restart|move|convert|translate|optimize|merge|investigate|debug|rename|migrate|upgrade|speed|generate|turn)\\b)",
